\protect\hypertarget{_bookmark0}{}{}\textbf{Abstract}

The Rogue Device Detection System improves LAN security by detecting and
removing unwanted devices in real time. It effectively detects rogue
devices and possible sniffers by using methods including OEM/OUI-based
identification, whitelist verification, active network scanning, and
promiscuous mode monitoring. The system is built on Django and
PostgreSQL, and it includes an easy-to-use dashboard for device
administration, alarms, and reporting. High detection accuracy and
scalability were shown throughout testing. This method of security
provides a scalable and reliable way to protect network settings against
unwanted access.

