  accurate IP and MAC addresses.
\item
  \textbf{Whitelist Verification Module}: Tested identification of
  authorized and unauthorized devices.
\item
  \begin{quote}
  \textbf{Alert System Module}: Checked alert generation upon rogue
  device detection.
  \end{quote}
\item
  \textbf{Administrator Dashboard}: Validated functionality of forms,
  buttons, and data retrieval.
\end{itemize}

