  \end{quote}
\item
  \begin{quote}
  Cross-checking against the whitelist and generating an alert if
  necessary.
  \end{quote}
\end{itemize}

\begin{quote}
The average response time was maintained below 5 seconds, ensuring
real-time alerting.
\end{quote}

