  \textbf{Small Network} (up to 50 devices): The system performed
  consistently without any issues.
  \end{quote}
\item
  \begin{quote}
  \textbf{Medium Network} (up to 200 devices): Response time remained
  stable.
  \end{quote}
\item
  \begin{quote}
  \textbf{Large Network} (up to 1000 devices): Required slight database
  optimizations but remained operational and efficient.
  \end{quote}
